                    Extract.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d352-f2" n="2" xml:id="d352-f2-content">
                <p>The members of the Junta were General Antonio Kebreau,
                    Colonel Adrien Valvule, and Colonel Emile
                        Zamor.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
